{
  "title": "警惕 Fastjson 1.x 零日漏洞 CVE-2026-16723：针对 Spring Boot 应用的无补丁攻击活动频发",
  "covers": [
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-safe-hub/main/assets/today/cover_01.gif",
